sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Chat UI (page.tsx)
    participant API as Backend /stream (chat.py)
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Primary as Primary Index (JSON, in-memory)
    participant Embed as Embedding provider (Gemini/OpenAI)
    participant PGV as Supabase / pgvector
    participant LLM as LLM provider (Gemini/OpenAI)
    participant Audit as Supabase audit tables

    User->>UI: types question, hits Send
    UI->>API: POST /api/rag/chat/stream<br/>{message, top_k}, Bearer token (if logged in)
    Note over API: rate limit check (20/min)

    opt Authorization header present
        API->>Auth: get_current_user_optional() → verify token
        Auth-->>API: user (or none — never blocks this endpoint)
    end

    Note over API: retrieve_with_trace() — the one function<br/>every question passes through

    API->>Primary: _enhanced_retrieve(query, top_k)
    Primary->>Embed: embed_texts([query])
    Embed-->>Primary: query embedding (numbers)
    Primary->>Primary: cosine similarity vs. in-memory vectors
    Primary-->>API: top_k chunks + confidence score

    API->>API: compare confidence to RAG_QUALITY_THRESHOLD (0.5)

    alt confidence too low, or nothing found
        API->>PGV: _pgvector_retrieve(query, top_k)
        API->>Embed: embed_texts([query])
        Embed-->>API: query embedding
        API->>PGV: pgvector_search() → RPC match_chunks()
        PGV->>PGV: cosine similarity search (SQL function)
        PGV-->>API: matched chunks (or empty)
        alt pgvector found something
            API->>API: replace results, used_fallback = true
        else pgvector also empty
            API->>API: keep original weak result — something beats nothing
        end
    else confidence good enough
        API->>API: use primary result as-is
    end

    API->>API: chat_id = new UUID, build source cards
    API->>PGV: find_similar_queries(query) → RPC match_queries()
    PGV-->>API: similar past questions (best-effort, ok if empty)

    API-->>UI: SSE event "meta"<br/>{chat_id, sources, trace, similar_queries}
    UI->>UI: render department badges + trace panel (path used, confidence)

    API->>API: _build_context_texts(docs)
    API->>API: _enforce_token_budget() — trim to fit MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS
    opt context had to be trimmed
        API-->>UI: SSE event "warning"
    end

    API->>API: get_prompt_for_query() → system + user messages
    API->>API: LLMClient() picks OpenAI (if key set) else Gemini

    API->>LLM: stream_with_messages(messages)
    loop each generated chunk
        LLM-->>API: next piece of text
        API-->>UI: SSE event "token" {content}
        UI->>UI: append chunk, answer types itself on screen
    end

    API->>API: estimate token usage, processing_time_ms
    API-->>UI: SSE event "done" {model, usage, processing_time_ms}
    UI->>User: full answer shown, with sources + trace + feedback buttons

    par best-effort, after response already sent
        API->>Audit: log_query() — writes fact_query + citation rows
    and
        API->>Audit: upsert_query_embedding() — stores this question for future "similar questions"
    end

    opt user rates the answer
        User->>UI: clicks 👍 / 👎
        UI->>API: POST /api/rag/chat/feedback {query_id, rating}
        API->>Audit: set_feedback() → updates fact_query.user_rating
    end
